name modernposter
category Package
revision 47269
shortdesc A modern LaTeX poster theme
relocated 1
longdesc This class extends the a0poster class in that it adds support
longdesc to easily create posters without the need for taking care of
longdesc the layout at all. It allows to use \maketitle to generate a
longdesc fancy header containing the title information and also provides
longdesc macros to position various different types of text boxes in a
longdesc two-column layout. The color scheme is inspired by the
longdesc metropolis beamer theme.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/modernposter/modernposter.cls
